## 🔥 BLOCKERS (resolve today)

- [ ] **D0** Push a placeholder build to Play **closed testing** — personal
      accounts need 12 testers opted in for 14 continuous days before production.
      This is the longest lead time in the whole plan. See `docs/05-store-launch.md` 🔥
- [ ] **D0** Recruit 12 closed-test testers as a group **separate** from your
      internal testers. Play makes internal testers ineligible for closed tests,
      so the same people on both tracks means the 14-day clock never starts. 🔥
- [ ] **D0** Confirm the app category does not require an organisation account
      (health, finance, VPN and government apps do, and D-U-N-S takes up to 30 days) 🔥
- [ ] **D0** Verify a physical Android device through the Play Console mobile app
- [ ] **D1** Book a borrowed iPhone for D17-D18 — write the contact and the
      slots here 🔥
- [ ] **D1** Confirm the Apple Developer account is active (approval takes days)

